{"id":"lane-whatsnew","parent":"ssbk0aum","ord":"a0","title":"olai — What's new: the app tells you what changed, every PR, linking the PR (Opus; artifact gate before implementation)","todo":true,"desc":"DISCARDED at the artifact gate on the human's word 2026-08-19 (\"Nah, let's remove this from the roadmap. Not worth adding it\").\n\n- The gate worked exactly as designed: the design artifact (https://claude.ai/code/artifact/14d79b58-d814-4b61-b7a6-778669dccc6c) was fielded, the human looked, and no implementation code was ever written.\n- Author terminal f04e0023 killed.\n- Worktree whats-new removed.\n- Roadmap node whats-new archived un-doing'd.\n\n**dispatched** — the human's word 2026-08-19","created":"2026-08-19T18:21:37-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:35-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","gate":"design artifact fielded to the human for visual confirmation BEFORE any implementation — the human's own dispatch condition","repo":"repo-olai"}}
