{"id":"store-graduation","parent":"whp4jmv8","ord":"a0","title":"Watch item: does @olai/store move out of this repo?","todo":true,"desc":"- The idea: if the store's source stays still long enough, it may deserve to live outside this repo as its own package. No move now.\n- The trigger wording is unsettled (candidates: untouched across two releases; 180 quiet days; 90 quiet days plus a second consumer) — and the clock restarted anyway: 8 commits landed in store/src since 08-13.\n- When a trigger fires, decide then.","changed":"2026-08-21T14:45:40-04:00","custom":{"clock":"interrupted — debate #3 (2026-08-19) verified 8 commits into store/src since 08-13, the face (index.ts) twice; stillness counts from the LAST src edit, not 2026-08-12; and whether the socket absorbing volatility resets or reinforces the clock is the same wording question this node parks (docs/lowy-electricity/debate-2026-08-19.md, corrections)"}}
