{"id":"dag-pr-review-grok","parent":"eqd5og95","ord":"a0","title":"review: grok","todo":true,"desc":"Reader of the worktree — fans out with the other review the moment refactor is done. SPAWN SHAPE (the charter's rule, enforced by the human 2026-08-16): a reviewer opens as a SPLIT of the author's terminal — kolu create --parent &lt;author-terminal&gt; --cwd &lt;worktree&gt; — never as a top-level terminal.","after":["dag-pr-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-15T19:05:46-04:00","changed":"2026-08-16T14:14:55-04:00"}
