{"id":"deploy-2026-08-21","parent":"98nyswd4","ord":"a0","title":"2026-08-21: production deploy, double watcher death, full end-to-end verification","date":"2026-08-21","desc":"DEPLOYED ~21:20; the orchestrator's own process restarted ~21:25 — the watch died loudly both times as designed and was re-armed (bhb2ugljn). The second restart recycled every terminal id (the kolu skill's warning made real): the A/B experiment terminal died, every lane's terminal prop went stale, the mute list was rewritten.\n\nThen kolu#2194's FULL TEST with a real agent (terminal c01109d6, 21:28–21:35) — ALL STAGES PASSED: spawn+boot; typed prompt + Enter; READY in 1s; settle → test watch (--held-for 10s) transition arriving instantly (per-line flush verified); nag re-rings at exactly +45s/+90s; main watch (--held-for 60s) transition at +60s; second prompt → second transition; screen_text, kolu ls, --ignore mute list, --ignore-self, --heartbeat; loud death + re-arm twice; kill → terminal gone, state-knob watch silent by design. Verdict: GOOD — every claim exercised live on the production build.","created":"2026-08-25T16:28:07-04:00"}
