{"id":"td-review-pi","parent":"vwl2alm8","ord":"a2","title":"review: pi (split)","done":"2026-08-25T22:41:13-04:00","after":["td-implement"],"created":"2026-08-25T18:54:57-04:00","changed":"2026-08-25T22:41:19-04:00","custom":{"retired":"2026-08-25T22:43:00-04:00","reviewer":"agent-pi","terminal":"8b04a25a","verdict":"REQUEST CHANGES — 1 MUST (screen.ts's window vs padi's absolute startLine: real-padi common case = a legitimate-looking empty snapshot; the fake ignored the window, hence green e2e) + 3 SHOULDs (the fake's real clamp; skew/drop arms fenced; the merge-order node — filed by the orchestrator) + 3 NITs; purity/mirror/pin/isolateEnv PASS. Probe spent reading the pinned kolu source. PR comment on #405."}}
{"id":"td-implement","parent":"vwl2alm8","ord":"a3","title":"the dot + the snapshot pane against #2216's pin + open PR","done":"2026-08-25T22:28:24-04:00","desc":"FIRST PASS STOPPED CORRECTLY on two #2216 contract gaps (19:05 — the pin-and-hold design's first payoff): (1) osfacts-client in the manifest closure but absent from the vendored GitHub archive (grafted by kolu's nix from an npins pin, gitignored — the closure test green only in kolu's own grafted tree); (2) a type-only need reaching through @kolu/surface-daemon's barrel — needs a ./lifetime leaf entry, vocab.ts:17 repointed. Both routed verbatim to the #2216 author (/tmp/td-gaps-for-2216.md) at 19:10. Checked and SOUND, no amendment needed: terminals keys+get, screen.text, agentBucket→the four dot faces (no urgency gap), connectPadi's dial + DaemonContractSkewError, @kolu/surface ./mirror. The td author waits; on the amended head it re-pins and the downstream (mirror, procedures.screen, chips, suites, evidence) unblocks.","created":"2026-08-25T18:54:49-04:00","changed":"2026-08-27T10:31:50-04:00","custom":{"pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/405","terminal":"b3d2298f"}}
