{"id":"lane-kolu-create-placement","parent":"day-2026-08-16","ord":"aF","title":"kolu-create-placement","done":"2026-08-16T21:20:11-04:00","desc":"Roadmap item `kolu-create-placement`, a KOLU PR ruled by the human: creating a terminal must state its placement.\n- The padi endpoint takes a required `toplevel | childOf(terminalId)`.\n- The CLI requires exactly one of `--toplevel` / `--parent` and errors otherwise, no default anywhere.\n- Humans create terminals on the canvas (which fills placement explicitly); the CLI belongs to scripts, and scripts are where the silent-toplevel drift lived.","created":"2026-08-16T14:17:34-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T18:16:44-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","repo":"repo-kolu"}}
