{"id":"lane-kp-review-grok","parent":"lane-kolu-create-placement","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok","done":"2026-08-16T19:18:40-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** do not object to merge. 4 findings, all suggestions, no bugs.\n- padi/src/surface.ts:765 — schema comment + test title claim child-of-without-parentId yields PLACEMENT_REQUIRED, but decode actually fails with \"Missing key\".\n- website changelog unreleased.mdx:72 — the #2167 entry still shows `kolu create --repo … --worktree …` without --toplevel.\n- padi/src/cliClient/render.ts:110 — shared parse treats `--parent \"\"` as a statement, so padi-tui dials before refusing blank while kolu create refuses pre-connect.\n- padi-tui/src/main.ts:688 — padi-tui's pre-dial gate is not pinned through cmdCreate the way kolu create's run is.\n- Reviewed at head 834a4807.","after":["lane-kp-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T14:17:34-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T18:59:45-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"292319bb-b718-4107-80a0-cb06337f6430"}}
{"id":"lane-kp-review-opencode","parent":"lane-kolu-create-placement","ord":"a3","title":"review: opencode","done":"2026-08-16T19:24:31-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** no objection to merge; zero findings.\n- **Verified locally:** placement rule single-sourced and decode-enforced across all six faces.\n- 67 test cases across padi/kolu-cli/padi-tui/kolu-mcp green; full workspace typecheck green.\n- Untyped string-verb callers (padiCall, Nix shell RPC) all fixed; docs/skills reconciled with generated copies byte-identical.\n- Noted out-of-scope: gitignored apm_modules vendored copies still teach `{parentId}`; refresh on next `just ai::apm-update`.\n- Reviewed at head 834a4807.","after":["lane-kp-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T14:17:34-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T18:59:45-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"8a4a8285-ef59-49b3-9aa6-b071de9c28bd"}}
