{"id":"lane-kp-ci","parent":"lane-kolu-create-placement","ord":"a6","title":"CI green at head","done":"2026-08-16T20:18:29-04:00","desc":"Both platforms landed on final head 7fa10292b — 55 contexts reported: 54 pass, 1 pre-existing fail.\n- Linux: 24/24 ok in 11m25s.\n- Darwin: green after one rerun.\n  - ci::upgrade-window@aarch64-darwin first failed at connect (SocketOpenError before any create call) on a pathologically loaded box (ci::nix 727s vs 8s, nix eval-cache \"database is busy\"); linux twin passed on the same sha; rerun passed — timing, not the placement rule.\n  - ci::unit@aarch64-darwin is the pre-existing FSEvents red, byte-identical on unmodified origin/master; this diff touches nothing under packages/integrations/.\n- **FLAGGED by author, not buried:** ci::daemon@aarch64-darwin was SKIPPED (ci/mod.just declares `daemon: install unit`, so darwin daemon suites cannot run while unit is red there) — darwin daemon coverage is not being exercised, on master as much as this branch; linux daemon ran and passed.","after":["lane-kp-merge-master","lane-kp-address"],"created":"2026-08-16T14:17:34-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T18:59:45-04:00"}
