{"id":"lane-quiet-outline","parent":"day-2026-08-16","ord":"aG","title":"quiet-outline","done":"2026-08-16T17:20:59-04:00","desc":"Roadmap item `quiet-outline` — the decluttering proposal.\n- **HISTORY:** first dispatched to GROK 2026-08-16; the human judged the work bad and ordered it deleted — terminal killed, worktree and branch removed (no PR had been opened, the branch held no commits).\n- REDISPATCHED to CLAUDE OPUS the same hour, so the cross-review flips back to grok.\n- This lane keeps its **EXTRA #human GATE:** after implement, the human reviews the design by running the branch in their browser BEFORE any reviewer agent is spawned.","created":"2026-08-16T14:23:11-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T18:16:44-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","repo":"repo-olai"}}
