{"id":"lane-qo-design","parent":"lane-quiet-outline","ord":"a1","title":"design review #human — before any reviewer spawns","done":"2026-08-16T16:23:29-04:00","desc":"#human gate — **PRE-APPROVED** by the human 2026-08-16 (\"the quiet outline - this is good, you can dispatch reviewers once the PR is ready\").\n- When the draft PR lands with CI green and screenshots, this gate flips done without a further ask and the reviewers (grok + opencode, splits of the author's terminal) fan out immediately.\n- The human may still run the branch in the browser in parallel; their feedback routes to the address round.","after":["lane-qo-implement"],"created":"2026-08-16T14:23:11-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:22-04:00"}
