{"id":"lane-darwin-fsevents","parent":"day-2026-08-16","ord":"aH","title":"kolu-darwin-unit-fsevents","done":"2026-08-17T00:40:26-04:00","desc":"Roadmap item `kolu-darwin-unit-fsevents`, a KOLU PR ruled by the human (dispatch, 2026-08-16): make darwin's unit lane green again.\n- The git FSEvents churn tests are structurally red on ci@petit (red on master too), which skips every darwin daemon suite (`daemon: install unit` in ci/mod.just) and forces `--admin` merges past the required context.\n- Fix for real or skip-with-pinned-reasoning.\n- Reconcile with PR #2172's darwin-only skips of two of these tests.","created":"2026-08-16T21:21:17-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T18:16:44-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","repo":"repo-kolu"}}
{"id":"lane-df-implement","parent":"lane-darwin-fsevents","ord":"a0","title":"implement + open PR","done":"2026-08-16T23:12:35-04:00","desc":"PR #2176 at ce96cfe, 48/48 required contexts green BOTH platforms.\n- **Root cause:** parcel startStream omits `kFSEventStreamCreateFlagNoDefer`; petit's fseventsd degenerate (21d up, 6.5GB, ~190% CPU) → delivery collapses to the daemon's max coalescing window (~15s) vs the tests' 3s budget — deterministic red.\n- **Fix:** real fix (calibrated budget) tried and MEASURED flaky (1/16 cycles silent 180s) → two delivery-gated cases skip darwin-only, numbers pinned in shared fs-watch-delivery.testlib.ts.\n  - parcel SKILL.md gains failure mode 5; transcript in kolu issue #2175.\n- ci::daemon@aarch64-darwin ran for the first time in 20+ pipelines (green after moving a fixture's 1s binary-launch wait to `awaitStarted()` 30s).\n- Unrelated linux dial.test.ts flake flagged not fixed.\n- Reconciled with #2172 by comment: its darwin guards (87b909c, bd85894) are load-bearing for nothing; suggests dropping them and rebasing after #2176.\n- **HUMAN ASK for morning:** restart fseventsd on petit (or reboot) — if delivery returns sub-second, the skip is one constant from coming back off.","created":"2026-08-16T21:21:17-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:22-04:00","custom":{"pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/2176","terminal":"9f5b3e3f-71c3-4730-83b2-716b6d74a5e5"}}
