{"id":"lane-df-review-grok","parent":"lane-darwin-fsevents","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok","done":"2026-08-16T23:45:50-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** do not object to merge, after the deferred two-platform run.\n- Findings 1–3 are comment/PR-body hygiene, not defects:\n  - (1) same as opencode's — the testlib's parcel-measurement justification covers skips whose own probe was 1.3s (index.test.ts fs.watch cases, real rationale = historical #320 contention).\n  - (2) memorySampler.testlib.ts:24 comment says fixture runs alongside daemon-forked PTYs, but it only re-runs sequentially in that recipe.\n  - (3) PR body still says the testlib holds the full transcript and the skill was edited under .claude/.\n  - (4) nit — index.test.ts:25 import placement.\n- **Also ruled:** no changelog needed (not a product-behavior change), no user-facing caveat for petit's sick fseventsd.\n- Reviewed at f7b236ee1.","after":["lane-df-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T21:21:17-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:22-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"0a425238-499f-4e9c-b7cb-a7e9ba6a23ab"}}
{"id":"lane-df-review-opencode","parent":"lane-darwin-fsevents","ord":"a3","title":"review: opencode","done":"2026-08-16T23:36:27-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** no objection to merge; finding 1 is a one-sentence clarification worth making, not blocking.\n- (1) minor docs-layer bug, fs-watch-delivery.testlib.ts:1-28 — cites parcel-only measurements (14.2s/180s silence) as justification for a constant that ALSO gates index.test.ts's fs.watch-backed tests, whose measured delivery was 1.3s and whose real skip rationale is historical #320 contention.\n- (2) suggestion — testlib references the skill's failure mode by number (\"failure mode 5\"), rots if a mode is inserted; name it.\n- (3) suggestion — the paused/PAUSED_FIXTURE_TIMEOUT_MS pairing rule lives only in the timeout's docstring; put it at the paused field's doc.\n- (4-7) verified sound: apm-source discipline (three trees byte-identical, lockfile updated), citations verbatim against issue #2175's table, skip-masking risk low (invariants platform-independent, pinned by linux every commit), testlib extraction and timeout derivation clean.\n- Reviewed at f7b236ee1.","after":["lane-df-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T21:21:17-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:22-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"df74cd06-4ccb-42f2-952b-b44891097bb9"}}
