{"id":"overnight-queue-2026-08-16","parent":"day-2026-08-16","ord":"aI","title":"Overnight queue (ruled 2026-08-16 night): 12 items approved via question tool, 3 Opus authors concurrent, auto-merge on clean evidence","desc":"Human's overnight authorization for tonight's dispatch.\n\n- **Policy:** dispatch to Opus, auto-merge each PR unless it genuinely requires human review (then leave open and flag in the morning report).\n- **Review findings:** addressed IN the same PR unless there is a strong reason to defer — a strong-reason deferral gets a #deferral roadmap node with from=&lt;PR&gt; and is flagged in the morning, not asked overnight.\n- **Cap:** max 3 Opus authors at once (reviewers don't count).\n- **RUNNING:** kolu-darwin-unit-fsevents (9f5b3e3f), model-indices-3 (41ce9a96), chat-model-reverts-on-restart (a2108cbd).\n- **QUEUE**, in dispatch order as slots free:\n  - chat-at-completion\n  - chat-subagent-live-face\n  - just-e2e-node-leak\n  - search-is-blocked\n  - search-relative-dates\n  - search-quoting-or\n  - search-everywhere (the four search PRs run one at a time — same grammar surface)\n  - preview-body-not-shipped\n  - check-targets-index\n  - model-indices-4 (only after model-indices-3 merges)\n- **Rejected for tonight:** chat-subagent-asks, preview-postload-growth, unsent-discriminate, prop-value-bound, search-saved.\n- **Also on the human's desk for morning:**\n  - PR #2172 (libghostty) — its grok finished green and asked for review/merge\n  - a separate #2172 audit terminal (306c52cb) is waiting on whether to post its next audit comment\n  - Neither is mine to drive.","created":"2026-08-16T21:28:19-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T18:16:44-04:00"}
