{"id":"lane-mi3-review-grok","parent":"lane-model-indices-3","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok","done":"2026-08-16T22:42:43-04:00","desc":"- **Round 1** (d3d48cb): OBJECTED — ids() kept stale byId key order on same-id-set reorder/cross-file move (reproduced twice).\n  - Plus 3 suggestions: benchmark claim, README overclaim, stale docblock.\n  - Full review: /tmp/grok-1000/grok-review-be01936c.md\n- **Round 2** (c579c92, after fix): DO NOT OBJECT.\n  - One residual test note: the hand-written cross-file ord-tie case passes even if bySibling is only byOrd; edit the earlier sibling (a.olai) so byCorpus is what restores the order, making a byOrd-only bySibling fail.\n  - Sent to author to fold in before merge.","after":["lane-mi3-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T21:24:21-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:22-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"bc92c57f-646a-4ce6-a826-3daaf08474ba"}}
{"id":"lane-mi3-review-opencode","parent":"lane-model-indices-3","ord":"a3","title":"review: opencode","done":"2026-08-16T22:30:12-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** no objection to merge — no bug found.\n- Every attempt to push a wrong answer through a decline path either declines, is caught by viewOf's identity check, or is unreachable via the store's real flows.\n- (1) accepted risk, patch.ts:34/validate.ts:151 — a wrong delta yields a confident wrong view; viewOf's identity check converts such cases to rebuilds, so correctness rests on the probe cache's identity guarantees rather than a runtime proof.\n- (2) perf suggestion self-resolved, patch.ts:326 — `new Map(byId)` dominates keystroke cost, overlay-map lever already named in the doc's open question 1.\n- (3) test suggestion, patch.test.ts:258 — tighten the decline bound (~20%) so a slow leak of patchable cases into fallback fails.\n- (4) test suggestion, patch.test.ts:186 — generator never surgically relocates an id between files (claim-checks cover it anyway).\n- (5) praise — the Since tests and validate-both-ways seam tests pin exactly the breakable promises.\n- Reviewed at head d3d48cb.","after":["lane-mi3-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T21:24:21-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:22-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"c24765bf-dfd6-4984-9270-6e06d9e28b1f"}}
