{"id":"lane-cac-review-grok","parent":"lane-chat-at-completion","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok","done":"2026-08-17T00:16:06-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** do not object to merge — 0 bugs, 4 suggestions (pending review 4948366618, read via API).\n\n- completion.ts — mid-sentence take writes a double space (inserted appends trailing space, written keeps the tail); drop one when the caret is already on whitespace.\n- CompletionMenu.tsx — cursor never resets on query change, so typing/backspacing reorders the shortlist under a walked index and Enter can take a different file than the arrows landed on (the row editor's list already resets).\n- packages/web/README.md — \"those same two key sets\" antecedent still points at the manifest for document paths; name the outlines collection's keys and the documents collection's key set.\n- chat_at_completion.feature — the live-update scenario never asserts \"the page has not reloaded\", so a full reload would still pass.\n- Reviewed at cd6a004c.","after":["lane-cac-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T22:52:50-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:09-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"13f88f47-f8dd-4015-ba7a-8bd508bce64d"}}
{"id":"lane-cac-review-opencode","parent":"lane-chat-at-completion","ord":"a3","title":"review: opencode","done":"2026-08-17T00:13:16-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** no objection to merge — reproduced the PR's evidence (10/10 e2e, 22/22 unit, 96/96 sibling features).\n\n- **Invariants held under scrutiny:** two triggers can't arm by construction; the path set is the server's, no second walker; the fold is version-keyed; dismissal is word-scoped.\n- Rename complete.\n- **Findings 1–3 (commentary/suggestions):**\n  - Composer.tsx:323 — rewrite()'s caret survival relies on Solid short-circuiting the redundant value assign while all engines clobber caret on identical-string sets; comment overstates, untested.\n  - files.ts:86 + served.tsx:45 — WeakMap key is a fresh array per source-signal bump, so \"folded once per version\" is really \"once per replace\".\n  - Composer.tsx:233 — a clicked row resolves path+caret from the render-time closure; a directory frame landing same-tick can write a shifted path with caret clamped to end.\n- **Findings 4–8:** intended/clean/strong observations incl. chat_steps.ts:1300 caret assertion is focus-only.\n- Reviewed at cd6a004c.","after":["lane-cac-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-16T22:52:50-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:00:09-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"1c3a5a82-1410-4950-b7a8-b706a3c619c0"}}
