{"id":"lane-sqo-review-grok","parent":"lane-search-quoting-or","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok","done":"2026-08-17T03:24:56-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** do not object to merge.\n\n- Precedence (OR appends to current group; groups AND; a OR b c → [[a,b],[c]] verified with tight-reading tests), tokenizer contract, operator-only OR groups, four-door refusal path, and untouched-matcher claim all check out.\n- **Findings 6–11, polish:**\n  - (6) a docs sentence still says every word must appear \"in the same node\", false once OR exists.\n  - (7) searching.ts:129 + docs/search.md:15 say a mid-token quote \"only suspends the space\" after the PR named that 36\" is refused.\n  - (8) filter.test.ts:550 — precedence pinned only as `a b OR c`; `a OR b c` untested.\n  - (9) searching.ts:130 — model-facing grammar names unclosed quotes but not dangling OR or \"\"/\" \".\n  - (10) an_external_agent.feature:238 — e2e misses empty-phrase, palette, mixed-case unclosed echo, and is:blocked/date: OR combinations.\n  - (11) docs/search.md:19 — \"not-both has no spelling\" is false: -a OR -b is that query.\n- Reviewed at f098e37.","after":["lane-sqo-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-17T02:25:08-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:01:00-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"609e5778-8a72-4765-8fdf-0a184d8516de"}}
{"id":"lane-sqo-review-opencode","parent":"lane-search-quoting-or","ord":"a3","title":"review: opencode","done":"2026-08-17T03:26:25-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** no objection to merge.\n\n- All design rulings implemented as stated (tight-binding OR; phrase = term whose word holds a space; quoted = text at token front; unclosed/empty/whitespace phrase refuses; joiner refusal suppressed on early scan stop).\n- Matcher change genuinely minimal.\n- Four doors ride one parseFilter.\n- Refusal contract consistent across ops, tool schema, e2e.\n- Empirical tokenizer/negation probes found no divergence.\n- One suggestion: a one-line doc example (the -a OR -b spelling, same as grok's #11).\n- Reviewed at f098e37.","after":["lane-sqo-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-17T02:25:08-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:01:00-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"a268cc20-6b6c-4f97-ba76-0d41ccc20867"}}
