{"id":"lane-tds-review-grok","parent":"lane-techdebt-sweep","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok","done":"2026-08-17T15:31:50-04:00","desc":"**Verdict:** do not object to merge — 0 bugs, 3 suggestions, 2 nits (full review /tmp/grok-1000/grok-review-b7e97ba7.md).\n- \"Production call sites keep their old answers, the risky unifications are pinned by verbatim copies rather than by the new function.\"\n- (1) selectors.ts:39 — the browser proof cites the wrong feature file.\n- (2) selectors.test.ts:126 — the fence covers one spelling, not every hand-built attribute selector.\n- (3) sweep.ts:93 — the line-first stripper opens the INVERSE silent-pass (/* // … */).\n- (4) nit, format README:8 — \"names no caller passes\" overclaims (noteDateOf passes daily notes).\n- (5) nit, selectors.ts:45 — the evaluate table is add/remove/same, not add/del/context.\n- Reviewed at 6cdbf3a.","after":["lane-tds-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-17T13:55:26-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:04:19-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"35f61b14-e621-437f-ad69-1df227673ead"}}
