{"id":"lane-sp-shape","parent":"lane-second-pane","ord":"aA","title":"prepare the layout value for horizontal splits (human's requirement)","done":"2026-08-17T16:58:43-04:00","desc":"Ruled by the human 2026-08-17, after reading the author's own hickey/lowy analysis (which admitted: \"the refactor passes... did not ask the tiling question, so they could not decline it on purpose\").\n- **Requirement:** future horizontal/nested splits.\n  - The addressable layout value becomes recursive (leaf = route | split = axis + children + fractions), with today's behaviour restricted to one horizontal root split.\n  - The URL codec becomes a bijection over that form, with today's flat spelling preserved byte-for-byte as the canonical one-level row.\n  - collapse === fraction 0 preserved on the child.\n  - Pure geometry extracted to pane/geometry.ts, axis-parameterized where free.\n- **NOT building** the horizontal UI/gestures — the doc must state what the shape permits and what a future PR still owes.","after":["lane-sp-ci2"],"created":"2026-08-17T16:10:45-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:04:19-04:00","custom":{"sha":"342a27e2"}}
