{"id":"lane-xyne-ts-client","parent":"day-2026-08-17","ord":"aH","title":"xyne-boxes #24 — TypeScript client + curl installer (human's own lane, orchestrator drives reviews)","done":"2026-08-19T18:15:14-04:00","desc":"Not an olai roadmap item — a lane the human handed the orchestrator mid-session.\n- **Provenance:** author grok in terminal b4b62caa, worktree ~/code/xyne-boxes/.worktrees/ts, PR https://github.com/juspay/xyne-boxes/pull/24.\n- **Why tracked here:** an untracked lane is one the orchestrator supervises only by attention — the failure this file's Challenges section is about.\n- **Round 1:** refactor passes done (architecture-first-principles, hickey+lowy together, fresh-eyes); opencode reviewed and OBJECTED with 3 merge-blockers, posted as PR comment 5320577273.\n- **Round 2** (human's ruling 2026-08-17): after the author's fixes land, re-review with BOTH opencode and a fresh CLAUDE OPUS reviewer, each posting its review as a PR comment per the new instructions.md rule.","created":"2026-08-17T17:43:18-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T18:16:45-04:00","custom":{"pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/xyne-boxes/pull/24","repo":"repo-xyne-boxes"}}
