{"id":"lane-sigterm","parent":"day-2026-08-20","ord":"a0","title":"olai — olai.service dies by outside SIGTERM: Restart/SuccessExitStatus interplay + find the sender (Grok; reviewer opencode)","done":"2026-08-20T10:34:29-04:00","desc":"Dispatched 2026-08-20 09:5x on the human's word. Brief: scratchpad briefs/service-sigterm.md (+ common.md).\n- Orchestrator's host evidence in the brief: the live unit HAS Restart=on-failure but SuccessExitStatus=130 makes the SIGTERM exit a success, so on-failure never fires — the roadmap's \"no Restart=\" is stale. At 23:06 and 06:01 the journal shows `received SIGTERM` with NO systemd Stopping/Stopped line (unlike the deliberate 20:49 / 08:12 restarts): something signalled the process directly, during nix-daemon-heavy windows (overnight lanes' e2e/CI).\n- Deliverables: module.nix + check.nix + running.md together, RCA in docs/RCA/, transient-unit restart proof (never touching the live 7714 service), sender found or ruled-out list.\n\n`pr` (as written, pre-typing): #280 merged aef63ec76 (squash on the human's approval, 10:34; head c8f9fd2c, 9/9 required)","created":"2026-08-20T09:56:51-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T18:17:03-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","approval":"the human approved #280 at 10:28 — gate open; finishing: opencode's RCA nit addressed, CI re-green at the new head, then squash","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/aef63ec76327eaa8e0bdb682a92d99fa873e4478","merged":"2026-08-20T10:33:50-04:00","opencode-verdict":"do not object — hm-module check rebuilt at head, man systemd.service Table 1 confirmed, incident timeline reproduced read-only row-for-row, RCA's 9 ruled-out rows spot-checked; 2 non-blocking: stale roadmap sentence (orchestrator's), RCA should say the live unit gains the policy at the next home-manager switch — https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/280#issuecomment-5357247053","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/280","repo":"repo-olai","reviewer":"agent-opencode","worktree":".wor