ased membership tests. #345 re-pins to 020f05af, then its CI + the measurement.","kolu-reland-review":"grok 5b0df208: DO-NOT-OBJECT at 78a4869c (11:41, 9m) — https://github.com/juspay/kolu/pull/2202#issuecomment-5381214561 — bound verified against effect rc.110 source (Stream.buffer → Channel.bufferArray, pump forkIn(scope), pull Queue.takeAll, suspend cannot deadlock at teardown); 512+4,096<6,000 true after the pump starts but reServeSurface's test is the always-on-drain tripwire, NOT the 512-arithmetic pin; batching tests pin the property; membership rewrite keeps exact counts (11/11 × 9 repeats). should-fix: server.ts:371-374 wrong test file + numerically-off/mis-named bound in the comment; Changelog entry; ODU-IMPACT sentence. nits: reactive-honesty through-line; streamFromAbortableSource still Arr.of (NO DEFERRALS → fold or ask); unused options param in streamBatching.test.ts. Killed 11:43 after posting (weekly limit 3%). Address brief briefs/address-2202.md sent 11:44; CI once more at the new head, both platforms.","kolu-reland-run4":"12:10 quiet Linux run of kolu#2202 @490dda2 under the localhost flock; box load 50–80 from the human's due-muscle `just check` during it. Interim from the lane logs 12:31 (orchestrator read-only): ci::unit PASS (33 + 9 test files), ci::e2e 514/514 PASS (the code_tab mouse-drag scenario passed), ci::home-manager PASS (all VM tests built; the 'opening file' line was VM-internal in a test that succeeded), ci::daemon still running (previousRelease upgrade-window e2e). macOS already fully green twice.","master-red":"FALSE ALARM (12:10): the author's own worktree had a stale, mixed node_modules in which node:net's Server no longer resolved to @types/node's; master 40386b36 typechecks green (and #343's CI typechecked green on both platforms after #344). The hotfix worktree/branch is torn down unused; no hotfix PR. Lesson on the board: a local typecheck is trusted only after a clean install of the head's lockfile.","outcome":"MERGED d6f80e78 12:53 (olai #345) + kolu#2202 020f05af — the node's three fixes: append representation (Change.appends + `saying` member keyed row#offset), 120 ms cadence, and a bounded round-trip batch in kolu. Bytes 1,118 kB → 19.6 kB loopback / 1,093 kB → 18.6 kB at 200 ms RTT. Costs of the lane: the orchestrator admin-merged kolu#2199 unverified (found red, reverted #2201, re-landed #2202 with a bounded buffer and settle-based membership tests); the round-trip half was argued by test, not reproduced by the author's relay.","pr-url":["https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/345","https://github.com/juspay/kolu/pull/2199"],"repo":"repo-olai","stop-and-ask":"RULED 10:58 REVERT (kolu#2201 = 9a1137b8). RULED 11:23 by the human: (a) — kolu's collectionKeysMembership tests rewritten to settle rather than count hops (behaviour pinned unchanged; ≥10 stable runs), then the re-land PR opens with Stream.buffer(512, suspend) and goes through full odu on both platforms before merge. Measurement: under the localhost flock, own instrument.","worktree":".worktrees/transcript-stream-quadratic"}}
