23 09:05 — the author waited idle ~10 h 50 m (the watcher nagged every 10 min; the orchestrator's turn had ended after the question tool answered without sending). Relayed 09:05.","ruled-override":"the human 2026-08-23 10:35 (question tool): a TINY kolu PR for the two `override` keywords via /be --skip-gauntlet + /ci both platforms; orchestrator merges; #352 re-pins. Relayed to the author 10:35 (immediately this time).","stop-and-ask":"22:12 — the brief's named gate hit: after POST /capture is deleted, `olai surface capture --url …` cannot replace the remote Mail.app/Raycast recipe (running.md:286) because bespoke verbs run client-side over ops.run, which is in AGENT_FACE only (faces.ts:340), never BROWSER_FACE — and --url dials the BROWSER websocket (listener.ts:149); @kolu/surface-remote is not pinned. Only `ssh <vault-host> olai surface capture` works today (needs ssh; captured-by becomes the OS user, not the Tailscale login). Options: (1) delete as specified, recipe → ssh, reword captured-by claims; (2) delete but add a second websocket face serving AGENT behind the identity header in this PR (preserves the recipe; --url works; a real trust widening; contradicts 'not in the first cut'); (3) keep POST /capture until a remote face exists (a deferral). Author recommends 2 if the recipe must keep working, else 1; proceeding meanwhile with the additive steps 1-4. Put to the human 22:15."}}
