{"id":"overnight-2026-08-24","parent":"day-2026-08-24","ord":"aD","title":"overnight 2026-08-24→25 — the human sleeps 9h; waves launch as slots free (Opus ≤3)","desc":"The human's word 20:32-20:50 (queue CONFIRMED via question tool; mirrors below ARE the queue — each item's mark moves with its lane, its dispatch-trigger prop says when it launches): the three in-flight PRs auto-merge; ALL FLAKES MUST BE ADDRESSED BY TONIGHT; night-2 perf pulled forward.\n\nStanding orders: no questions overnight — a blocked lane parks and says why; CI once at close; reviewers read-only; kill by PID; ≤3 Opus concurrent; everything lands in the morning summary.\n\nRunning at queue time: zsr (Opus), sidx (Opus, folding), cq (Opus) = 3/3 Opus; tuc (pi, reporting); pldb (grok).\n\nExplicitly NOT tonight (the human declined): referrers-render-markdown (filed), kolu-one-shot-submit, chat-rewind pin bump. Skipped by standing design: #needs-brainstorm, #human-gated, the flip PRs.","created":"2026-08-24T20:39:15-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T20:41:32-04:00"}
