{"id":"day-debate-2026-08-25","parent":"day-2026-08-25","ord":"aN","title":"The fourth lowy-electricity debate — three sockets ratified, zero packages, zero kolu","done":"2026-08-25T18:58:50-04:00","desc":"Special sitting on the day's bug harvest (fable packages / grok upstream / opencode modules — pi opened the module chair, its provider died mid-sitting, opencode took its old seat back). Conclusion filed at [lowy-electricity/debate-2026-08-25.md](../lowy-electricity/debate-2026-08-25.md) on the human's ratification; the three findings filed as PR-shaped items (see edges). The cold-boot severity ruling waits as verdict-boot-policy (#human, after the Verdict).","see":["meaning-socket","verdict-shape","vintage-reads"],"created":"2026-08-25T18:58:50-04:00"}
