{"id":"overnight-2026-08-26","parent":"day-2026-08-26","ord":"a6","title":"Overnight orders","done":"2026-08-27T11:24:05-04:00","desc":"The human sleeps; review is theirs in the morning. The order: take BOTH PRs to full readiness and CI — olai #405 (kolu#2217's finding-8 head re-pinned, foreign-resize recovery wired, suites green, then the author-run close odu CI, verdict verified by the orchestrator) and kolu#2217 (finding 8 folded, pushed, drishti #147 bumped to the final head, then the author-run /ci both platforms on the orchestrator's order). BOTH HELD UNMERGED — the human reviews both tomorrow; no merges, no deploys overnight.\n\nVIDEO EVIDENCE (the human, ~21:35): both PRs carry video for the morning review, and the orchestrator verifies from it. #405: the live pane over a busy agent — open, deltas flowing, theme, foreign-resize recovery (ordered to cb9dcd13). kolu#2217: ordered with the /ci order at its final-head report (its messages get lost when crossing turn ends — deliver at a confirmed stop).","created":"2026-08-26T21:29:31-04:00","changed":"2026-08-27T11:24:05-04:00"}
